@startuml MemberA_State_Engagement
title Member A — State machine: Engagement (REQ-A-01, UC-01 / UC-02)
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Draft : Practitioner submits brief

Draft --> Draft : LLM timeout / retry
Draft --> Scoped : StructuredScope confirmed
Draft --> Failed : abandoned

Scoped --> DocumentsIn : files uploaded
Scoped --> Scoped : policy edit (UC-09)

DocumentsIn --> DocumentsIn : parse error; replacement file
DocumentsIn --> Parsed : ParserAgent persist + accept
DocumentsIn --> Failed : unreadable sources, no override

Parsed --> ReadyForReview : intake gate satisfied
Parsed --> DocumentsIn : practitioner rejects preview

ReadyForReview --> Closed : report issued (UC-07)
ReadyForReview --> DocumentsIn : replacement artefact (UC-08 trigger)
ReadyForReview --> Failed : max replans / cancelled job

Failed --> [*]
Closed --> [*]

note right of Draft
  LLM perception of NL brief
  and decision of WorkPlan
end note

note right of DocumentsIn
  LLM perception of tables;
  amounts never invented
end note

@enduml
